sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Citizen
  participant App as RoadShield app
  participant AI as AI service (FastAPI)
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth
  participant St as Supabase Storage
  participant DB as Postgres (RPC + RLS)
  participant PD as push-dispatch
  participant EP as Expo Push → APNs/FCM

  U->>App: Capture photo, confirm location
  App->>App: Resize + strip EXIF, save draft (SQLite)
  App->>AI: POST /v1/analyze (photo, Bearer JWT)
  AI->>Auth: Verify JWT (JWKS, cached)
  AI->>AI: YOLOv8 inference · blur faces/plates
  AI-->>App: payload {detection_id, requested_by, model, detections…} + HMAC signature
  App->>U: Show boxes, category, confidence
  U->>App: Accept or correct category, submit
  loop each photo (resumable)
    App->>St: upload <uid>/<draftId>/<n>.jpg
  end
  App->>DB: rpc submit_hazard_report(draft id, fields, images, payload, signature)
  DB->>DB: rate limit · validate · verify HMAC and requested_by = caller
  DB->>DB: insert hazard (RS-YYMM-NNNNN) · status_history · ai_detections
  DB->>DB: insert notification (report_confirmation)
  DB--)PD: pg_net POST (x-dispatch-secret)
  DB-->>App: {id, public_code, status: submitted, ai_verified}
  PD->>DB: claim notification, read tokens + locale
  PD->>EP: send localized push
  EP--)U: "Report RS-2610-00042 received"
